1
00:00:00,043 --> 00:00:03,743
Um, does Pottery Barn,
Spring count?

2
00:00:05,849 --> 00:00:08,819
(Beverly:)Penny, it's only natural to want
your mother-in-law to like you,

3
00:00:08,818 --> 00:00:11,988
(Beverly:)and I acknowledge I can be
an intimidating person.

4
00:00:11,988 --> 00:00:15,728
(Beverly:)So what can I do to make
this process easier for you?

5
00:00:15,725 --> 00:00:17,025
(Penny:)Uh, for starters,

6
00:00:17,026 --> 00:00:19,156
(Penny:)maybe you can not psychoanalyze
everything I say?

7
00:00:19,162 --> 00:00:21,492
(Beverly:)And how does it
make you feel

8
00:00:21,498 --> 00:00:24,568
(Beverly:)when I psychoanalyze
everything you say?

9
00:00:24,567 --> 00:00:26,937
(Penny:)Uncomfortable.

10
00:00:26,936 --> 00:00:28,206
(Beverly:)That was a joke, dear.

11
00:00:28,204 --> 00:00:29,774
(Penny:)Oh. Sorry.

12
00:00:29,773 --> 00:00:31,573
(chuckles)
Didn't know you made those.

13
00:00:33,276 --> 00:00:35,006
(Penny:)Hey, listen, what
if we have a little

14
00:00:35,011 --> 00:00:38,011
mother-in-law-daughter-in-law
dinner tonight?

15
00:00:38,014 --> 00:00:40,044
(Beverly:)So just the two of us?

16
00:00:40,049 --> 00:00:42,579
(Penny:)Or I invite a few girlfriends,

17
00:00:42,585 --> 00:00:43,985
(Penny:)'cause hearing you say
“the two of us”

18
00:00:43,987 --> 00:00:46,257
(Penny:)just sent a chill
right down my spine.

19
00:00:48,758 --> 00:00:50,758
(car door opens)

20
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:52,760
(Leonard:)Hey.

21
00:00:52,762 --> 00:00:54,192
(Amy:)What are you doing here?

22
00:00:54,197 --> 00:00:55,197
(Amy:)You're not Sheldon.

23
00:00:55,198 --> 00:00:59,018
(Stuart:)I thought that might come up.

